== Foundation

The Foundation phase establishes the prerequisites for secure development: clear responsibilities, and the competence to act on them. Work on it before, or in parallel with, early development work.

.*What this phase covers*
[%collapsible]
====
[mermaid]
----
flowchart LR
    R[Responsibilities] --> C[Competence]
----

* *Responsibilities* — make security accountability explicit by assigning people to security-related project roles.
* *Competence* — ensure that the people in those roles have the cybersecurity knowledge their role demands, and arrange training where they do not.

The controls listed below are the authoritative scope of this phase. Installed extension modules may add further controls here.
====

=== Why it matters

Without assigned roles, tasks fall through the cracks. Without competence, even good processes produce weak results. Foundation addresses both.

